&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the Client Relationship: &lt;/strong&gt;Own the client relationship end-to-end — day-to-day communication, deliverables (reports, proposals, strategic planning docs), and hands-on execution of the agreed strategy. Lead client meetings, educate clients beyond reporting, and communicate the real, accurate cause o

